  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.24 “Incremental new production” means the difference between the yearly electricity output of an eligible source and its historical generation baseline.\n\nSource. #9037, INTERIM, eff 11-27-07, EXPIRED: 5-25-08\n\nNew. #9169, eff 6-3-08; ss by #10741, eff 12-5-14 (from Puc 2502.22); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (formerly Puc 2502.23)",
